{"id":"vod_hh_60064","vodId":"60064","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"逮捕令 全速前进","name_cn":"逮捕令 全速前进","date":"2007-01-01","year":"2007","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第24集","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/4cc39b42f22ee5987819b83fc055cb33.jpg"},"summary":"人气女警动画《逮捕令》系列第五次TV动画化成功并定于今年秋季开播。藤岛康介原作的《逮捕令》自1986开始至1992连载于1982年创刊《周刊morning》增刊，1994年《逮捕令》以全四话OVA动画初入人们的映像视野。其实早在2006年11月就传言新系列即将动画化，但直到半年后此消息才得到证实，此次2007年秋季播放的《逮捕令》定名为《逮捕令全速前进》。目前逮捕令新系列的官网已经开放。2007年9月25日其第二季动画DVD-BOX将会正式发售。《逮捕令全速前进》描写的是夏实与美幸不再搭档的却仍然互帮互助共同成长的新作，进入自卫队特殊部队的夏实与开始学习警察科学搜查的美幸在重新结成搭档的时候战斗力肯定大幅度上升维护东京和平。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-06-15 20:12:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":22,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/penXoJ7b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/0dNj2W2d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Ddw5Ag8a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/lejMk6yd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/1aMg2Wmd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Ddw5Agra/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/mepKqVVd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/oeEv2WWa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/penXoJ5b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Yer5v7pd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/1aKB2Exe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/QeZyorQd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/DbDr2EKe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/mepKqVQd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/RdGx2KJe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/rb2roDMb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第18集","url":"http